**Date:** 2025-11-10
**Author:** BIP
**Context:** Startup/Business Venture

---

## Executive Summary

The AI-Powered Personal Study Planner is a web-based application designed to help university and college students manage their study time effectively. It aims to automate the creation of personalized, adaptive study plans based on syllabus content, exam dates, and user preferences, dynamically adjusting to progress. Key considerations from initial brainstorming include a strong focus on intuitive UX/UI, ethical and performant AI integration, robust and scalable architecture, stringent data security, and comprehensive risk mitigation. The project emphasizes a resilient system with clear user feedback, streamlined workflows, and a consolidated approach to course management.

---

## Core Vision

### Problem Statement

